  <data key="d36">An increase in Russian operational tempo accelerates battlefield use, production and refinement of long‑range strike systems (notably drones and cruise missiles) and associated tactics that are then proliferated or emulated by Iran and its proxies, enabling higher frequency and scale of missile/drone attacks in the Gulf.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
