  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible disruption to sea lines of communication prompts security agencies and regulators to tighten export licensing and controls on sensitive technologies to limit supply-chain vulnerabilities and perceived leakage risks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
