  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Intense domestic political pressure (from voters or industry constituencies) accelerates legislative and executive action to expand scope, enforcement powers and resourcing of AI oversight bodies, strengthening regulation.</data>
