  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Intense domestic political pressure can drive near-term policy actions (export bans, tariffs, or import restrictions) that remove supply from markets or increase transaction costs, producing upward pressure on liquid fuel prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_trade_tech</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_supply_shock</data>
