  <data key="d36">Higher refinery throughput increases availability of refined fuels (diesel, jet fuel) required for mechanized and air operations, enabling higher tempo and geographic reach of military operations, while throughput drops constrain fuel supply and reduce operational intensity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">energy_supply_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
