  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained decreases in pipeline transit most commonly reflect physical closures, damage or preemptive shut‑offs that directly cause outages, flow interruptions and cascading operational losses across connected energy infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">energy_supply_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
